# Optional: Langfuse tracing for the generated CUGA implementation
# LANGFUSE_PUBLIC_KEY=
# LANGFUSE_SECRET_KEY=
# LANGFUSE_HOST=https://cloud.langfuse.com

# ── Launch scripts (migrate.sh / source_sync.sh / cuga_sync.sh) ────────────────
# Required — API key for Bob Shell's non-interactive CLI mode (`bob -p ...`)
BOBSHELL_API_KEY=

# Note: unlike the Claude Code version of this project, there is no
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL here — no documented Bob Shell flag/env var selects a model;
# Bob manages that at the IDE/tool level. The three .env files below are still
# required, same as before:
#
#   .env                    -> this file (BOBSHELL_API_KEY + optional Langfuse)
#   migration_from/.env     -> source system API keys / connection strings
#   migration_to/.env       -> CUGA runtime credentials (LLM API keys, MCP server env vars)
